[
  {
    "beat": 1,
    "flux": "A weathered female lighthouse keeper in oilskin coat kneels on wet stone dock at dawn, holding a fishing net with a small glowing blue fish pulsing inside. Wide shot from low angle, net fills foreground, keeper's profile and lighthouse tower rise behind. 35mm lens, shallow depth of field on fish. Soft cool dawn light, misty sea horizon. Palette of cool blues, muted grays, warm skin tones, electric cyan glow. Painterly realism, cinematic texture, fine detail.",
    "ltx": "Quiet dawn harbor. Water laps gently, mist drifts. Keeper's hands subtly tremble holding net, glowing fish pulses slowly with soft light. Camera slowly dollies in from wide to medium close-up on net. Gentle pacing, slight handheld wobble. Silent clip, no music, no speech. Ambient visual stillness, light flicker is only movement."
  },
  {
    "beat": 2,
    "flux": "Middle-aged lighthouse keeper climbs narrow spiral stone staircase inside lighthouse, carrying a wooden bucket with glowing fish illuminating her face. Composition centered on curved stairs spiraling upward, keeper mid-stride on edge. 50mm lens, medium shot from below looking up. Dramatic side light from window, storm clouds gathering outside. Palette of wet slate gray, amber lantern glow, electric blue fish light. Cinematic realism, moody painterly style, detailed stone texture.",
    "ltx": "Keeper ascends spiral stairs steadily, bucket swaying slightly, fish glow pulsing rhythmically. Storm wind howls visually through window, curtains flutter, rain streaks on glass, clouds darken overhead. Camera tracks upward with keeper in slow vertical dolly following steps. Pacing steady and determined, slight handheld shake. Silent clip, no music, no speech, only visual motion."
  },
  {
    "beat": 3,
    "flux": "Inside lighthouse lamp room at storm height, keeper stands before massive Fresnel lens, glowing blue fish in basin on stone table. Light from fish arcs upward flooding the room, refracting through lens into golden beam projecting out window. Wide symmetrical composition, keeper small left of frame, lens dominates center. 35mm lens, low angle looking up. Volumetric light beams, moody interior with warm gold and cool blue contrast. Palette of brass gold, deep navy, cyan glow. Hyper-realistic painterly style, cinematic lighting.",
    "ltx": "Fish glow intensifies and spills outward in slow radiant pulse, illuminating dust motes in lamp room. Keeper's hands release basin, light ripples up through Fresnel lens, beam rotates slowly and turns from white to warm gold sweeping across stormy sea beyond window. Camera slow push-in on lens, then gentle arc to window. Pacing builds gradually, luminous bloom expands. Silent, no music, no speech."
  },
  {
    "beat": 4,
    "flux": "Small fishing ship navigating treacherous rocky coastline at night during storm, golden lighthouse beam cutting through rain and mist across water. Ship sits center foreground, bow cutting waves, rock spires loom dark left side. Wide aerial-ish low angle from sea level looking toward lighthouse on cliff. 85mm lens, dramatic depth. Stormy light with warm gold beam contrasting cool indigo sea and black rocks. Palette of deep navy, storm gray, bright gold beam. Cinematic realism, painterly detail, high contrast.",
    "ltx": "Small ship pitches gently on heavy waves, bow advancing slowly through narrow passage between jagged rocks. Golden beam sweeps steadily across sea, illuminating spray and rain. Camera tracks with ship from side, slow lateral dolly keeping beam in frame. Pacing tense but calm, rock edges pass close. Silent clip, no music, no speech, only visual motion of water, light sweep, ship progression."
  }
]
